cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the analysis code or data, please cite as below. See LICENSE for details."
type: software
title: "Detecting and Mitigating Hallucinations in LLM-Generated Causal Loop Diagrams"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction package for MSc thesis on hallucination detection in LLM-generated
  Causal Loop Diagrams. Implements LLM-as-a-Judge, LLM-as-a-Corrector, uncertainty
  quantification metrics, and a Deep Research multi-agent validation system.
  Note: Analysis code is MIT licensed; research data is CC-BY 4.0; thesis text
  is copyright Nitai Nijholt (all rights reserved).
